Religion falls to one lesson, but health education opens with an opt-out. The
coalition can administer the compromise and Nowacka can train willing schools;
sexual-health and youth advocates know access will now depend most on the
parents and municipalities already least comfortable with the course.

- @poland_event_queue: File the optional settlement

