= February 2025 — An opposition programme, not a ministerial decree

Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** still heads a PiS cabinet, so the
historical ministry reform never becomes a national rule. <span class="party-ko"><b>Barbara Nowacka</b></span>
can supply an opposition draft. [? if left_in_government: Lewica serves inside
the cabinet, but PiS retains the education ministry; our ministers can force a
coalition argument, not issue its national rule.?][? if not
left_in_government: Lewica can supply organisers and a Sejm bill, but it does
not control the education ministry.?]

Teachers willing to run health classes, medical associations that can defend
the curriculum and parents who want their children included need a structure
that can outlast one press conference. We can prove the course locally, force
a defeated bill onto the record or build the coalition before asking it to
survive a PiS majority.

- @pis_school_pilots
- @pis_school_bill
- @pis_school_coalition

